<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Chapter 1 — Chemical Measurements | Comprehensive Exam</title>

<style>
:root {
  --bg:#f3f5f9;
  --card:#ffffff;
  --text:#202938;
  --muted:#687386;
  --primary:#3157a4;
  --primary-light:#e8eefc;
  --green:#16834b;
  --green-bg:#e6f6ed;
  --red:#c73535;
  --red-bg:#fff0ef;
  --border:#dce2ec;
  --shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(30,45,75,.08);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  line-height:1.65;
}
header{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#172e59,#3157a4);
  color:white;
  padding:30px 18px;
  text-align:center;
}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(23px,4vw,34px)}
header p{margin:8px 0 0;color:#dce7ff}
.container{max-width:950px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 14px}
.panel,.question-card{
  background:var(--card);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:15px;
  padding:20px;
  margin-bottom:18px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.stats{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:10px;
  text-align:center;
}
.stat{
  background:var(--primary-light);
  border-radius:12px;
  padding:12px 5px;
}
.stat strong{display:block;font-size:22px;color:var(--primary)}
.stat span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.progress-track{
  height:10px;background:#e5e9f1;border-radius:20px;
  overflow:hidden;margin-top:16px;
}
.progress-bar{
  height:100%;width:0;background:var(--primary);
  transition:width .25s;
}
.topline{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;
  gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:var(--muted);
  font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px;
}
.question-number{color:var(--primary);font-weight:bold}
.question-text{
  font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0 18px;
  white-space:pre-wrap;
}
.options{display:grid;gap:10px}
.option{
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;
  cursor:pointer;background:white;
  display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;
  transition:.15s;
}
.option:hover{border-color:var(--primary);background:#f7f9ff}
.option input{margin-top:5px;accent-color:var(--primary)}
.option.correct{border-color:var(--green);background:var(--green-bg)}
.option.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:var(--red-bg)}
.option.disabled{cursor:default}
.action-row{
  display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px;
}
button{
  border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;
  font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;
}
.primary-btn{background:var(--primary);color:white}
.secondary-btn{background:#e9edf5;color:#28364e}
button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
.feedback{
  display:none;margin-top:18px;padding:16px;
  border-radius:11px;white-space:pre-wrap;
}
.feedback.correct{display:block;background:var(--green-bg);border:1px solid #a8dfbd}
.feedback.wrong{display:block;background:var(--red-bg);border:1px solid #f0b6b2}
.feedback strong{display:block;margin-bottom:6px}
.explanation{margin-top:8px}
.question-input{
  width:100%;padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:9px;font-size:16px;
}
select.question-input{background:white}
.section-title{
  color:var(--primary);font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;
}
#startScreen{text-align:center}
#examScreen{display:none}
#resultScreen{display:none;text-align:center}
.score-big{font-size:48px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--primary)}
.review-item{
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:14px 0;text-align:left;
}
.review-item:last-child{border:0}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}
@media(max-width:520px){
  .panel,.question-card{padding:15px}
  .stats{gap:6px}
  .stat strong{font-size:19px}
  .question-text{font-size:16px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<header>
  <h1>Chapter 1: Chemical Measurements</h1>
  <p>Comprehensive Examination — 120 Questions</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <section id="startScreen" class="panel">
    <h2>Comprehensive Examination</h2>
    <p>This examination covers chemical concentrations, preparing solutions,
    SI units, unit conversions, calculations, and titration.</p>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><strong>120</strong><span>Total Questions</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>5</strong><span>Exam Parts</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>100%</strong><span>Instant Feedback</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted">Select an answer and submit it to receive immediate feedback.
